OL,5,G2300 Women Who Kill
OL,6,     FNew. We meet Amber, who was 19 and
OL,7,     Fpregnant when she pushed her
OL,8,     Fhusband out of a window, Patricia,
OL,9,     Fwho bludgeoned her cousin to
OL,10,     Fdeath, and Ana, who murdered her
OL,11,     Flover with a stiletto shoe.
OL,12,G0000 999 Rescue Squad
OL,13,     FThe response team race to the
OL,14,     Frescue of a worker trapped in a
OL,15,     Fcollapsed trench, and paramedic
OL,16,     FKim must risk her own life to give
OL,17,     Fhim medical treatment 10ft
OL,18,     Funderground.
